docs {
  # Delete Test Run

  Soft-deletes a test run. Requires `test_run:delete` permission and Contributor (or higher)
  role in the project.

  - `204 No Content` — deleted
  - `403 Forbidden` — missing permission or Viewer role
  - `404 Not Found` — not found or already soft-deleted
}
